===Noun===
{{de-noun|n,(e)s}}

# [[aeroplane]]
#: {{syn|de|Flieger<q:colloquial><g:m>|;|Maschine<q:informal><g:f>|;|Aeroplan<q:archaic><g:n,m>}}

====Usage notes====
* Despite the compound literally meaning "flight-thing", this is not a general term for any aircraft, for which see {{m|de|Luftfahrzeug|lit=air vehicle}}. For example, a {{m|de|Hubschrauber|t=helicopter}} is not a ''Flugzeug''.

